msgstr "Use cupons para indicação - juntamente com links afiliados"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:130
msgctxt "setting description tip of using coupons for referral"
msgid "Use the <code>Assign to affiliate</code> option while creating a coupon to link the coupon with an affiliate. Whenever that coupon is used, specified affiliate will be credited for the sale."
msgstr "Use a opção <code>Assign to affiliate</code> ao criar um cupom para vincular o cupom a um afiliado. Sempre que esse cupom for usado, o afiliado especificado será creditado pela venda."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:163
msgctxt "setting name for multi-tier affiliate program"
